NNAAMMEE
       g3topbm - convert a Group 3 fax file into a PBM image


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       gg33ttooppbbmm   [--kklluuddggee]  [--rreevveerrsseebbiittss]  [--ssttrreettcchh]  [--wwiiddtthh==_p_i_x_e_l_s  |  pa‐
       per_size={A3|A4|A5|A6|B4}] [--ssttoopp__eerrrroorr] [_g_3_f_i_l_e]

       Minimum unique abbreviation of option is acceptable.  You may use  dou‐
